  Sega; Qonecta+ is not affiliated with Sega.

NES emulator (Games > NES, the user's own ROM files):
  The main core is Nestopia (libretro port, https://github.com/libretro/nestopia, based on Nestopia JG,
  https://gitlab.com/jgemu/nestopia), copied unmodified into app/src/main/cpp/nestopia (source/core: GNU General
  Public License v2 or later; source/nes_ntsc by Shay Green: GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 or later;
  see the COPYING and license.txt files there). Its cartridge database (app/src/main/assets/nes/NstDatabase.xml)
  comes from the same project. The libretro frontend is not used: app/src/main/cpp/hql_nes.cpp is Qonecta+'s own
  JNI bridge. Both are combined with Qonecta+ under the "or later" terms and section 13 of the AGPL v3.
  The fallback core, the nescore module, is halfNES (https://github.com/andrew-hoffman/halfnes) by Andrew Hoffman, licensed under the
